abstract: >-
  A plain-language book series and verification package on the geometric
  organization, controlled transformation and preservation of high-dimensional
  photonic entanglement. Draft for technical review. AI-assisted research,
  documentation and numerical analysis. No experimental measurements.
keywords:
  - photonic quantum information
  - high-dimensional entanglement
  - orbital angular momentum
  - polarization
  - quantum memory
  - education
